  "name": "PSTrainSplat",
  "display_name": "PS Train Splat (LichtFeld)",
  "description": "Trains the splat with LichtFeld Studio, headless. Images carry the soft alpha, so every step composites them over a random background: the person has to be opaque on its own and edges keep their real transparency. MRNF densifies where the error map says detail is missing; pose refinement absorbs the small camera errors of generated frames; per-photo exposure correction absorbs their color drift; MoGe-2 normals keep surfaces from turning into stacked, see-through layers in the views the orbit never saw.",
